<title>ROMANIA: Romania nine-month current account gap $713 mln.</title>
<headline>Romania nine-month current account gap $713 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's current account deficit rose to $713 million over January-September from $708 million in the first eight months of this year, but narrowed from $1.02 billion a year ago, National Bank data showed.</p>
<p> ROMANIAN CURRENT A/C	   JAN-SEPT 96	 JAN-SEPT 95</p>
<p> Current account (million USD)	-713		   -1,022</p>
<p> Trade balance			-695		   -1,021</p>
<p> Exports (FOB)		     5,451		    5,770</p>
<p> Imports (FOB)		     6,146		    6,791</p>
<p> Services balance		    -67			-15</p>
<p> Income balance		     -219		     -174</p>
<p> Current transfers balance	 268			188</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
